                                                        Invoice Date
                                                    </th>
                                                    <th style="border-right:1px solid #000 !important;border: none;text-align:center;padding-right:5px;padding-left:5px;padding-top:5px; padding-bottom:5px; ">
                                                        Customer No.
                                                    </th>
                                                    <th style="border-right:1px solid #000 !important;border: none;text-align:center;padding-right:5px;padding-left:5px;padding-top:5px; padding-bottom:5px;">
                                                        Salesperson
                                                    </th>
                                                    <th style="border-right:1px solid #000 !important;border: none;text-align:center;padding-right:5px;padding-left:5px;padding-top:5px; padding-bottom:5px;">Order Number
                                                    </th>
                                                    <th style="border-right:1px solid #000 !important;border: none;text-align:center;padding-right:5px;padding-left:5px;padding-top:5px; padding-bottom:5px;">Order Date
                                                    </th>
                                                    <th style="border-right:1px solid #000 !important;border: none;text-align:center;padding-right:5px;padding-left:5px;padding-top:5px; padding-bottom:5px;">Customer PO</th>
